    text: "Affected stops:\r\nS Prince St & W Church Ave Gate E (#16081) (eastbound)\r\nW Alamo Ave & S Prince St Gate G (#20424) (eastbound)\r\nW Littleton Blvd & S Spotswood St (#15018) (eastbound)\r\nW Littleton Blvd & S Windermere St (#15001) (westbound)\r\nW Littleton Blvd & S Spotswood St (#15016) (westbound)\r\nW Main St & S Rio Grande St (#15176) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 66 get on/off buses at:\r\nArapahoe Community College (#11935)\r\nW Littleton Blvd & S Windermere St (#15019)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 66 get on/off buses at:\r\nW Littleton Blvd & S Datura St (#15006)\r\nW Church Ave & S Nevada St (#19865)"
